er prevent other players from accessing intended game content.\r\n\r\nThe following are prohibited:\r\n\r\nFloating structures.\r\nUnintended building exploits.\r\nExcessive foundation or pillar spam.\r\nBlocking player spawn areas.\r\nBlocking obelisks.\r\nBlocking boss terminals.\r\nBlocking mission terminals.\r\nBlocking artifact caves.\r\nBlocking wyvern trenches.\r\nBlocking public teleporters.\r\nBlocking important progression areas.\r\n\r\nMaximum of 2 cave bases per map per tribe.\r\n\r\n7. Illegal Base Locations\r\n\r\nOnly intended base locations are allowed.\r\n\r\nIllegal locations include:\r\n\r\nMesh bases.\r\nOut-of-bounds areas.\r\nRat holes requiring unintended movement.\r\nLocations accessible only by unconscious players, chairs, zip-lines, exploits or similar unintended mechanics.\r\n\r\nIf reaching your base requires exploiting the game, it is not allowed.\r\n\r\n8. Platform & Turret Exploits\r\n\r\nDo not abuse unintended building mechanics.\r\n\r\nExamples include:\r\n\r\nBypassing turret line of sight.\r\nFoundation range exploits.\r\nInvulnerable firing positions.\r\nPlatform builds that make creatures effectively immune to damage.\r\n\r\n9. FOB Rules\r\n\r\nForward Operating Bases (FOBs) are temporary.\r\n\r\nThey must:\r\n\r\nBe removed after the raid.\r\nBe removed within 48 hours if abandoned.\r\n\r\nThe following are not allowed:\r\n\r\nEmpty turret FOBs.\r\nPermanent FOBs.\r\nCave claims used only to reserve territory.\r\n\r\n10. Dino Rules\r\n\r\nDino stacking is allowed provided it does not intentionally create excessive server lag.\r\n\r\nStaff may require tribes to reduce excessive creature counts if server performance is affected.\r\n\r\n11. Caging Players\r\n\r\nPlayers may only be caged for a maximum of 2 hours.\r\n\r\nAfter this period they must be released or killed.\r\n\r\n12. Reporting Players\r\n\r\nIf you suspect cheating or rule violations, submit a support ticket with video or screenshot evidence whenever possible.\r\n\r\nPublic accusations without evidence may be removed.\r\n\r\n13. Punishments\r\n\r\nUnless otherwise stated:\r\n\r\nWarning → 24 Hour Ban → Permanent Ban\r\n\r\nSevere violations such as cheating, meshing, duping or repeated abuse may skip directly to a permanent ban.\r\n\r\n14. Rule Circumvention\r\n\r\nAttempting to exploit loopholes or intentionally bypass the spirit of these rules is considered rule breaking.\r\n\r\nIf something is clearly unfair but not explicitly listed, staff may still take action.\r\n\r\nStaff decisions are final.\r\n\r\n15. Common Sense\r\n\r\nPlay fair.\r\n\r\nRespect other players.\r\n\r\nHelp us build a competitive and enjoyable community.\r\n\r\nDon't be a dick."
